lass=\"sb-eyebrow\">Selected work</span><h2>Selected work that shipped.</h2><p>A snapshot of recent projects across eCommerce, LMS, custom plugins, and performance engineering. 70+ projects delivered overall.</p></div><div class=\"sb-projects__grid\"><!-- wp:smart-blocks/project-card {\"cat\":\"WooCommerce\",\"title\":\"Subscription commerce platform\",\"desc\":\"Custom subscription engine on WooCommerce powering a high-volume DTC brand. Dunning, proration, and a custom self-serve member portal.\",\"glyph\":\"WC\",\"gradient\":\"linear-gradient(135deg, #6d28d9 0%, #a78bfa 100%)\",\"tags\":[\"WooCommerce\",\"Stripe\",\"Custom Plugin\"]} -->\n<article class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-project-card sb-project\"><div class=\"sb-project__cover\" style=\"--cover:linear-gradient(135deg, #6d28d9 0%, #a78bfa 100%)\"><span class=\"sb-project__cover-glyph\">WC</span></div><div class=\"sb-project__body\"><span class=\"sb-project__cat\">WooCommerce</span><h3 class=\"sb-project__title\"><span>Subscription commerce platform</span></h3><p class=\"sb-project__desc\">Custom subscription engine on WooCommerce powering a high-volume DTC brand. Dunning, proration, and a custom self-serve member portal.</p><div class=\"sb-project__tags\"><span class=\"sb-tag\">WooCommerce</span><span class=\"sb-tag\">Stripe</span><span class=\"sb-tag\">Custom Plugin</span></div></div></article>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/project-card -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/project-card {\"cat\":\"LMS\",\"title\":\"Learning management system\",\"desc\":\"Custom LMS on WordPress with LearnDash extensions, certificate generation, drip content, and reporting dashboards.\",\"glyph\":\"LM\",\"gradient\":\"linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed 0%, #c4b5fd 100%)\",\"tags\":[\"LMS\",\"LearnDash\",\"ACF Pro\"]} -->\n<article class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-project-card sb-project\"><div class=\"sb-project__cover\" style=\"--cover:linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed 0%, #c4b5fd 100%)\"><span class=\"sb-project__cover-glyph\">LM</span></div><div class=\"sb-project__body\"><span class=\"sb-project__cat\">LMS</span><h3 class=\"sb-project__title\"><span>Learning management system</span></h3><p class=\"sb-project__desc\">Custom LMS on WordPress with LearnDash extensions, certificate generation, drip content, and reporting dashboards.</p><div class=\"sb-project__tags\"><span class=\"sb-tag\">LMS</span><span class=\"sb-tag\">LearnDash</span><span class=\"sb-tag\">ACF Pro</span></div></div></article>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/project-card -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/project-card {\"cat\":\"Block Library\",\"title\":\"Reusable ACF block library\",\"desc\":\"Shared ACF-based Gutenberg block library used across 30+ client sites: design tokens, accessibility, editor parity.\",\"glyph\":\"BL\",\"gradient\":\"linear-gradient(135deg, #16a34a 0%, #a78bfa 100%)\",\"tags\":[\"ACF Blocks\",\"Gutenberg\",\"Design Tokens\"]} -->\n<article class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-project-card sb-project\"><div class=\"sb-project__cover\" style=\"--cover:linear-gradient(135deg, #16a34a 0%, #a78bfa 100%)\"><span class=\"sb-project__cover-glyph\">BL</span></div><div class=\"sb-project__body\"><span class=\"sb-project__cat\">Block Library</span><h3 class=\"sb-project__title\"><span>Reusable ACF block library</span></h3><p class=\"sb-project__desc\">Shared ACF-based Gutenberg block library used across 30+ client sites: design tokens, accessibility, editor parity.</p><div class=\"sb-project__tags\"><span class=\"sb-tag\">ACF Blocks</span><span class=\"sb-tag\">Gutenberg</span><span class=\"sb-tag\">Design Tokens</span></div></div></article>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/project-card -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/project-card {\"cat\":\"Performance\",\"title\":\"Core Web Vitals rescue\",\"desc\":\"Reduced LCP from 4.8s → 1.2s, CLS from 0.34 → 0.02. Critical-CSS pipeline, image strategy, DB query refactor, edge caching.\",\"glyph\":\"PF\",\"gradient\":\"linear-gradient(135deg, #a78bfa 0%, #6d28d9 100%)\",\"tags\":[\"Performance\",\"CWV\",\"Caching\"]} -->\n<article class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-project-card sb-project\"><div class=\"sb-project__cover\" style=\"--cover:linear-gradient(135deg, #a78bfa 0%, #6d28d9 100%)\"><span class=\"sb-project__cover-glyph\">PF</span></div><div class=\"sb-project__body\"><span class=\"sb-project__cat\">Performance</span><h3 class=\"sb-project__title\"><span>Core Web Vitals rescue</span></h3><p class=\"sb-project__desc\">Reduced LCP from 4.8s → 1.2s, CLS from 0.34 → 0.02. Critical-CSS pipeline, image strategy, DB query refactor, edge caching.</p><div class=\"sb-project__tags\"><span class=\"sb-tag\">Performance</span><span class=\"sb-tag\">CWV</span><span class=\"sb-tag\">Caching</span></div></div></article>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/project-card -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/project-card {\"cat\":\"Custom Plugin\",\"title\":\"Internal workflow automation\",\"desc\":\"Custom plugin architecture automating internal business workflows: ticket routing, status sync, and stakeholder reporting.\",\"glyph\":\"WF\",\"gradient\":\"linear-gradient(135deg, #6d28d9 0%, #16a34a 100%)\",\"tags\":[\"Custom Plugin\",\"REST API\",\"Automation\"]} -->\n<article class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-project-card sb-project\"><div class=\"sb-project__cover\" style=\"--cover:linear-gradient(135deg, #6d28d9 0%, #16a34a 100%)\"><span class=\"sb-project__cover-glyph\">WF</span></div><div class=\"sb-project__body\"><span class=\"sb-project__cat\">Custom Plugin</span><h3 class=\"sb-project__title\"><span>Internal workflow automation</span></h3><p class=\"sb-project__desc\">Custom plugin architecture automating internal business workflows: ticket routing, status sync, and stakeholder reporting.</p><div class=\"sb-project__tags\"><span class=\"sb-tag\">Custom Plugin</span><span class=\"sb-tag\">REST API</span><span class=\"sb-tag\">Automation</span></div></div></article>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/project-card -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/project-card {\"cat\":\"Enterprise CMS\",\"title\":\"Corporate multisite migration\",\"desc\":\