>MySQL</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>WP-CLI</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>PHP 8</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Performance</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Multisite</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Headless</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Custom Plugins</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Code Review</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Team Lead</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>WordPress</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>ACF Pro</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Gutenberg</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>WooCommerce</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>React</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>REST API</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>MySQL</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>WP-CLI</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>PHP 8</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Performance</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Multisite</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Headless</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Custom Plugins</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Code Review</span><span class=\"sb-marquee__item\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Team Lead</span></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/marquee -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/about -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-about sb-section sb-about sb-reveal\"><div class=\"sb-container\"><div class=\"sb-about__layout\"><div class=\"sb-about__visual\"><div class=\"sb-image-slot\"><span class=\"sb-image-slot__label\">Image goes here</span></div></div><div class=\"sb-about__copy\"><span class=\"sb-eyebrow\">About</span><h2>Engineer-led WordPress, from planning to deployment.</h2><p>I\'m Sachin Suthar — based in Ahmedabad, India, with 7+ years building custom themes, plugins, and backend systems for eCommerce, LMS, and corporate platforms. I take projects from technical scoping all the way through code review and deployment: writing clean, maintainable code, fixing performance bottlenecks, and integrating third-party APIs. Familiar with WordPress VIP coding standards through certification. Currently expanding into React-based Gutenberg block development and PHPUnit testing.</p><div class=\"sb-about__highlights\"><div class=\"sb-about__highlight\"><strong>Ahmedabad, India</strong><span>Available worldwide · Remote-first</span></div><div class=\"sb-about__highlight\"><strong>7+ years experience</strong><span>Across 70+ shipped WordPress projects</span></div><div class=\"sb-about__highlight\"><strong>WP VIP standards</strong><span>Architecture, performance, and security</span></div><div class=\"sb-about__highlight\"><strong>MCA · Gujarat Tech Univ.</strong><span>CGPA 8.08 · BCA from HNGU (7.25)</span></div></div></div></div></div></section>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/about -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/services-grid {\"eyebrow\":\"01 · What I do\",\"heading\":\"Services tuned for ambitious WordPress products.\",\"dek\":\"Specialist services across the modern WordPress stack — from custom block development to performance engineering and CI-friendly deployments.\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-services-grid sb-section sb-services  sb-reveal\"><div class=\"sb-container\"><div class=\"sb-section-head\"><span class=\"sb-eyebrow\">01 · What I do</span><h2>Services tuned for ambitious WordPress products.</h2><p>Specialist services across the modern WordPress stack — from custom block development to performance engineering and CI-friendly deployments.</p></div><div class=\"sb-services__grid\"><!-- wp:smart-blocks/service {\"icon\":\"wp\",\"title\":\"Custom WordPress Development\",\"desc\":\"End-to-end custom themes, plugins, and admin-side tooling, built to WordPress VIP coding standards with clean architecture.\",\"showBar\":true,\"barLabel\":\"Expertise\",\"proficiency\":96} -->\n<article class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-service sb-service\"><div class=\"sb-service__head\"><div class=\"sb-service__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M2 12h20M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 0-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 0 4 10\"/></svg></div><h3 class=\"sb-service__title\">Custom WordPress Development</h3></div><p class=\"sb-service__desc\">End-to-end custom themes, plugins, and admin-side tooling, built to WordPress VIP coding standards with clean architecture.</p><div class=\"sb-service__bar-wrap\"><div class=\"sb-service__bar-head\"><span class=\"sb-service__bar-label\">Expertise</span><span class=\"sb-service__bar-pct\">96%</span></div><div class=\"sb-service__bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"96\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"><div class=\"sb-service__bar-fill\" style=\"width:96%\"></div></div></div></article>\n