b-hero__layout\"><div class=\"sb-hero__copy\"><span class=\"sb-hero__badge\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Senior WordPress Developer · 7+ years</span></span><h1><span>WordPress engineering, built for</span> <span class=\"sb-gradient\">long-term performance.</span></h1><p class=\"sb-hero__lede\">I\'m Sachin Suthar — a Senior WordPress Developer from Ahmedabad with 7+ years of hands-on experience across 70+ projects. I build custom themes, plugins, ACF and Gutenberg blocks, and performance-tuned WooCommerce stores for agencies, startups, and enterprise clients.</p><div class=\"sb-hero__currently\"><span class=\"bullet\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span>Currently leading WP engineering at <strong>NineGravity</strong></span></div><div class=\"sb-hero__cta\"><a class=\"sb-btn sb-btn--primary\" href=\"#contact\">Start a project</a><a class=\"sb-btn sb-btn--ghost\" href=\"#work\">View selected work</a></div><div class=\"sb-hero__chips\"><span class=\"sb-hero__chips-item\">WordPress VIP</span><span class=\"sb-hero__chips-item\">Gutenberg</span><span class=\"sb-hero__chips-item\">WooCommerce</span><span class=\"sb-hero__chips-item\">ACF Pro</span><span class=\"sb-hero__chips-item\">Headless WP</span><span class=\"sb-hero__chips-item\">Performance</span></div></div><div class=\"sb-hero__visual\"><div class=\"sb-image-slot\"><span class=\"sb-image-slot__label\">Image goes here</span></div><div class=\"sb-hero__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"sb-hero__mark-kicker\">Certified</span><span class=\"sb-hero__mark-title\">WP VIP</span></div><div class=\"sb-hero__statustag\"><div class=\"sb-hero__statustag-label\">Open to work</div><div class=\"sb-hero__statustag-text\">Senior WordPress roles, freelance &amp; consulting — 2026.</div></div></div></div><div class=\"sb-hero__metrics\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"sb-metric\" role=\"listitem\"><strong>7+</strong><span>Years of WordPress engineering</span></div><div class=\"sb-metric\" role=\"listitem\"><strong>70+</strong><span>Projects shipped end-to-end</span></div><div class=\"sb-metric\" role=\"listitem\"><strong>50+</strong><span>Custom themes &amp; plugins built</span></div><div class=\"sb-metric\" role=\"listitem\"><strong>30–50%</strong><span>Median performance gains</span></div></div></div></section>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/hero -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/about -->\n<section id=\"about\" class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-about sb-section sb-about sb-section--cream sb-reveal\"><div class=\"sb-container\"><div class=\"sb-about__layout\"><div class=\"sb-about__visual\"><div class=\"sb-image-slot\"><span class=\"sb-image-slot__label\">Image goes here</span></div></div><div class=\"sb-about__copy\"><span class=\"sb-eyebrow\">About</span><h2>Engineer-led WordPress, from planning to deployment.</h2><p>I\'m Sachin Suthar — based in Ahmedabad, India, with 7+ years building custom themes, plugins, and backend systems for eCommerce, LMS, and corporate platforms. I take projects from technical scoping all the way through code review and deployment: writing clean, maintainable code, fixing performance bottlenecks, and integrating third-party APIs. Familiar with WordPress VIP coding standards through certification. Currently expanding into React-based Gutenberg block development and PHPUnit testing.</p><div class=\"sb-about__highlights\"><div class=\"sb-about__highlight\"><strong>Ahmedabad, India</strong><span>Available worldwide · Remote-first</span></div><div class=\"sb-about__highlight\"><strong>7+ years experience</strong><span>Across 70+ shipped WordPress projects</span></div><div class=\"sb-about__highlight\"><strong>WP VIP standards</strong><span>Architecture, performance, and security</span></div><div class=\"sb-about__highlight\"><strong>MCA · Gujarat Tech Univ.</strong><span>CGPA 8.08 · BCA from HNGU (7.25)</span></div></div></div></div></div></section>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/about -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/services-grid {\"eyebrow\":\"01 · What I do\",\"heading\":\"Services tuned for <em>ambitious</em> WordPress products.\",\"dek\":\"Specialist services across the modern WordPress stack — from custom block development to performance engineering and CI-friendly deployments.\",\"anchor\":\"services\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-services-grid sb-section sb-services  sb-reveal\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"sb-container\"><div class=\"sb-section-head\"><span class=\"sb-eyebrow\">01 · What I do</span><h2>Services tuned for <em>ambitious</em> WordPress products.</h2><p>Specialist services across the modern WordPress stack — from custom block development to performance engineering and CI-friendly deployments.</p></div><div class=\"sb-services__grid\"><!-- wp:smart-blocks/service {\"icon\":\"wp\",\"title\":\"Custom WordPress Development\",\"desc\":\"End-to-end custom themes, plugins, and admin-side tooling, built to WordPress VIP coding standards with clean architecture.\"} -->\n<article class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-service sb-service\"><div class=\"sb-service__head\"><div class=\"sb-service__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M2 12h20M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 0-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 0 4 10\"/></svg></div><h3 class=\"sb-service__title\">Custom WordPress Development</h3></div><p class=\"sb-service__desc\">End-to-end custom themes, plugins, and admin-side tooling, built to WordPress VIP coding standards with clean architecture.</p></article>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/service -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/service {\"icon\":\"box\",\"title\":\"ACF & Gutenberg Block Dev\",\"desc\":\"Production-grade ACF blocks and native Gutenberg blocks. Editor UX that lets marketing ship without engineering.\"} -->\n<article class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-service sb-service\"><div class=\"sb-service__head\"><div class=\"sb-service__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z\"/><polyline points=\"3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"22.08\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"12\"/></svg></div><h3 class=\"sb-service__title\">ACF &amp; Gutenberg Block Dev</h3></div><p class=\"sb-service__desc\">Production-grade ACF blocks and native Gutenberg blocks. Editor UX that lets marketing ship without engineering.</p></article>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/service -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/service {\"icon\":\"cart\",\"title\":\"WooCommerce Engineering\",\"desc\":\"Custom checkouts, subscriptions, payment gateways, and ERP integrations for content-heavy stores.\"} -->\n<article class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-service sb-service\"><div class=\"sb-service__head\"><div class=\"sb-service__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"/><path d=\"M1 1h4l2.68 13.39a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h9.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61L23 6H6\"/></svg></div><h3 class=\"sb-service__title\">WooCommerce Engineering</h3></div><p class=\"sb-service__desc\">Custom checkouts, subscriptions, payment gateways, and ERP integrations for content-heavy stores.</p></article>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/service -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/service {\"icon\":\"plug\",\"title\":\"API Integrations\",\"desc\":\"REST and third-party API bridges to CRMs, payment processors, mailers, and back-office systems.\"} -->\n<article class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-service sb-service\"><div class=\"sb-service__head\"><div class=\"sb-service__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M9 2v6\"/><path d=\"M15 2v6\"/><path d=\"M6 8h12v4a6 6 0 0 1-12 0V8z\"/><path d=\"M12 18v4\"/></svg></div><h3 class=\"sb-service__title\">API Integrations</h3></div><p class=\"sb-service__desc\">REST and third-party API bridges to CRMs, payment processors, mailers, and back-office systems.</p></article>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/service -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/service {\"icon\":\"gauge\",\"title\":\"Performance Optimisation\",\"desc\":\"Core Web Vitals deep-dives, MySQL query optimisation, Redis/Batcache/edge caching. 30–50% measured gains.\"} -->\n<article class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-service sb-service\"><div class=\"sb-service__head\"><div class=\"sb-service__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 14l4-4\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"9\"/></svg></div><h3 class=\"sb-service__title\">Performance Optimisation</h3></div><p class=\"sb-service__desc\">Core Web Vitals deep-dives, MySQL query optimisation, Redis/Batcache/edge caching. 30–50% measured gains.</p></article>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/service -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/service {\"icon\":\"layers\",\"title\":\"Advanced Custom Fields (ACF)\",\"desc\":\"Modular content models with ACF Pro, custom post types, taxonomies, and user-role architectures.\"} -->\n<article class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-service sb-service\"><div class=\"sb-service__head\"><div class=\"sb-service__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><polygon points=\"12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2\"/><polyline points=\"2 17 12 22 22 17\"/><polyline points=\"2 12 12 17 22 12\"/></svg></div><h3 class=\"sb-service__title\">Advanced Custom Fields (ACF)</h3></div><p class=\"sb-service__desc\">Modular content models with ACF Pro, custom post types, taxonomies, and user-role architectures.</p></article>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/service -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/service {\"icon\":\"cube\",\"title\":\"Elementor · WPBakery · Divi\",\"desc\":\"Custom widgets, dynamic data, and visual-builder workflows that match designer intent without sacrificing performance.\"} -->\n<article class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-service sb-service\"><div class=\"sb-service__head\"><div class=\"sb-service__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z\"/></svg></div><h3 class=\"sb-service__title\">Elementor · WPBakery · Divi</h3></div><p class=\"sb-service__desc\">Custom widgets, dynamic data, and visual-builder workflows that match designer intent without sacrificing performance.</p></article>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/service -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/service {\"icon\":\"terminal\",\"title\":\"WP-CLI Automation\",\"desc\":\"Idempotent CLI scripts for migrations, content imports, environment setup, and CI/CD-friendly deploys.\"} -->\n<article class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-service sb-service\"><div class=\"sb-service__head\"><div class=\"sb-service__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><polyline points=\"4 17 10 11 4 5\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"19\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"19\"/></svg></div><h3 class=\"sb-service__title\">WP-CLI Automation</h3></div><p class=\"sb-service__desc\">Idempotent CLI scripts for migrations, content imports, environment setup, and CI/CD-friendly deploys.</p></article>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/service -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/service {\"icon\":\"spark\",\"title\":\"AI-assisted Development\",\"desc\":\"n8n, Claude Code, OpenAI Codex, ChatGPT, Antigravity, Cursor — modern tooling to ship faster without compromising code quality.\"} -->\n<article class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-service sb-service\"><div class=\"sb-service__head\"><div class=\"sb-service__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 3l2.39 5.84L20 11.21l-4.5 3.91L17 21l-5-3.1L7 21l1.5-5.88L4 11.21l5.61-2.37L12 3z\"/></svg></div><h3 class=\"sb-service__title\">AI-assisted Development</h3></div><p class=\"sb-service__desc\">n8n, Claude Code, OpenAI Codex, ChatGPT, Antigravity, Cursor — modern tooling to ship faster without compromising code quality.</p></article>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/service -->\n\n</div></div></section>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/services-grid -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/skills-showcase {\"eyebrow\":\"02 · Toolkit\",\"heading\":\"Skills sharpened by 7+ years of shipping.\",\"dek\":\"A focused stack centred on WordPress, ACF, and the infrastructure that keeps enterprise products durable.\",\"anchor\":\"skills\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-skills-showcase sb-section sb-skills sb-section--cream sb-reveal\" id=\"skills\"><div class=\"sb-container\"><div class=\"sb-section-head\"><span class=\"sb-eyebrow\">02 · Toolkit</span><h2>Skills sharpened by 7+ years of shipping.</h2><p>A focused stack centred on WordPress, ACF, and the infrastructure that keeps enterprise products durable.</p></div><div class=\"sb-skills__grid\"><!-- wp:smart-blocks/skill {\"icon\":\"php\",\"name\":\"PHP 7 / 8 (OOP)\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-skill sb-skill\"><div class=\"sb-skill__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" rx=\"10\" ry=\"5\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"15\" font-size=\"6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-weight=\"700\">PHP</text></svg></div><span class=\"sb-skill__name\">PHP 7 / 8 (OOP)</span></div>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/skill -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/skill {\"icon\":\"wp\",\"name\":\"WordPress\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-skill sb-skill\"><div class=\"sb-skill__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M2 12h20M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 0-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 0 4 10\"/></svg></div><span class=\"sb-skill__name\">WordPress</span></div>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/skill -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/skill {\"icon\":\"box\",\"name\":\"ACF / ACF Pro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-skill sb-skill\"><div class=\"sb-skill__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z\"/><polyline points=\"3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"22.08\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"12\"/></svg></div><span class=\"sb-skill__name\">ACF / ACF Pro</span></div>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/skill -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/skill {\"icon\":\"layers\",\"name\":\"Gutenberg Blocks\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-skill sb-skill\"><div class=\"sb-skill__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><polygon points=\"12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2\"/><polyline points=\"2 17 12 22 22 17\"/><polyline points=\"2 12 12 17 22 12\"/></svg></div><span class=\"sb-skill__name\">Gutenberg Blocks</span></div>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/skill -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/skill {\"icon\":\"cart\",\"name\":\"WooCommerce\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-skill sb-skill\"><div class=\"sb-skill__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"/><path d=\"M1 1h4l2.68 13.39a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h9.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61L23 6H6\"/></svg></div><span class=\"sb-skill__name\">WooCommerce</span></div>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/skill -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/skill {\"icon\":\"js\",\"name\":\"JavaScript (ES6+)\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-skill sb-skill\"><div class=\"sb-skill__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"16\" font-size=\"7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\" font-family=\"monospace\" font-weight=\"700\">JS</text></svg></div><span class=\"sb-skill__name\">JavaScript (ES6+)</span></div>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/skill -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/skill {\"icon\":\"react\",\"name\":\"React (Gutenberg)\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-skill sb-skill\"><div class=\"sb-skill__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"/><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" rx=\"10\" ry=\"4\"/><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" rx=\"10\" ry=\"4\" transform=\"rotate(60 12 12)\"/><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" rx=\"10\" ry=\"4\" transform=\"rotate(120 12 12)\"/></svg></div><span class=\"sb-skill__name\">React (Gutenberg)</span></div>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/skill -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/skill {\"icon\":\"db\",\"name\":\"MySQL · Query Tuning\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-skill sb-skill\"><div class=\"sb-skill__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"/><path d=\"M3 5v6c0 1.66 4.03 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5\"/><path d=\"M3 11v6c0 1.66 4.03 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3v-6\"/></svg></div><span class=\"sb-skill__name\">MySQL · Query Tuning</span></div>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/skill -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/skill {\"icon\":\"rest\",\"name\":\"REST API · Webhooks\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-skill sb-skill\"><div class=\"sb-skill__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M7 9l-2 3 2 3M17 9l2 3-2 3M14 7l-4 10\"/></svg></div><span class=\"sb-skill__name\">REST API · Webhooks</span></div>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/skill -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/skill {\"icon\":\"terminal\",\"name\":\"WP-CLI\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-skill sb-skill\"><div class=\"sb-skill__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><polyline points=\"4 17 10 11 4 5\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"19\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"19\"/></svg></div><span class=\"sb-skill__name\">WP-CLI</span></div>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/skill -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/skill {\"icon\":\"git\",\"name\":\"Git · GitHub · GitLab\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-skill sb-skill\"><div class=\"sb-skill__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"6\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"M6 16V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8\"/><path d=\"M18 8v8\"/></svg></div><span class=\"sb-skill__name\">Git · GitHub · GitLab</span></div>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/skill -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/skill {\"icon\":\"gauge\",\"name\":\"Core Web Vitals\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-skill sb-skill\"><div class=\"sb-skill__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 14l4-4\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"9\"/></svg></div><span class=\"sb-skill__name\">Core Web Vitals</span></div>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/skill -->\n\n</div></div></section>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/skills-showcase -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/experience-timeline {\"eyebrow\":\"03 · Experience\",\"heading\":\"A practical journey through the <em>WordPress ecosystem.</em>\",\"dek\":\"7+ years of building WordPress products across agencies, SaaS, eCommerce, LMS, and government platforms.\",\"anchor\":\"experience\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-experience-timeline sb-section sb-experience  sb-reveal\" id=\"experience\"><div class=\"sb-container\"><div class=\"sb-section-head\"><span class=\"sb-eyebrow\">03 · Experience</span><h2>A practical journey through the <em>WordPress ecosystem.</em></h2><p>7+ years of building WordPress products across agencies, SaaS, eCommerce, LMS, and government platforms.</p></div><ol class=\"sb-timeline\"><!-- wp:smart-blocks/timeline-item {\"period\":\"2024 — Present\",\"role\":\"Senior WordPress Developer · Team Lead\",\"org\":\"NineGravity — Ahmedabad, India\",\"desc\":\"Lead development of WordPress projects used in live production. Built custom plugin architecture that automates internal business workflows. Conduct code reviews, enforce WP Coding Standards, define technical scope with PMs and stakeholders. Resolve critical live-site bugs with minimal downtime.\",\"tags\":[\"Team Lead\",\"Custom Plugins\",\"Code Review\",\"WP Standards\",\"MySQL Tuning\"]} -->\n<li class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-timeline-item sb-timeline-item\"><div class=\"sb-timeline-item__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"sb-timeline-item__period\">2024 — Present</span><h3 class=\"sb-timeline-item__role\">Senior WordPress Developer · Team Lead</h3><p class=\"sb-timeline-item__org\">NineGravity — Ahmedabad, India</p><p class=\"sb-timeline-item__desc\">Lead development of WordPress projects used in live production. Built custom plugin architecture that automates internal business workflows. Conduct code reviews, enforce WP Coding Standards, define technical scope with PMs and stakeholders. Resolve critical live-site bugs with minimal downtime.</p><div class=\"sb-timeline-item__tags\"><span class=\"sb-tag\">Team Lead</span><span class=\"sb-tag\">Custom Plugins</span><span class=\"sb-tag\">Code Review</span><span class=\"sb-tag\">WP Standards</span><span class=\"sb-tag\">MySQL Tuning</span></div></li>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/timeline-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/timeline-item {\"period\":\"2019 — 2024\",\"role\":\"Senior WordPress Developer\",\"org\":\"SilverWebBuzz Pvt. Ltd. — Ahmedabad\",\"desc\":\"Built 50+ custom themes and plugins for business-critical websites across eCommerce, LMS, and corporate platforms. Implemented custom post types, taxonomies, and user roles; integrated third-party APIs; used WP-CLI to automate DB operations and deploys; reduced page-load times through query optimisation.\",\"tags\":[\"Custom Themes\",\"WooCommerce\",\"API Integrations\",\"WP-CLI\",\"Performance\"]} -->\n<li class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-timeline-item sb-timeline-item\"><div class=\"sb-timeline-item__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"sb-timeline-item__period\">2019 — 2024</span><h3 class=\"sb-timeline-item__role\">Senior WordPress Developer</h3><p class=\"sb-timeline-item__org\">SilverWebBuzz Pvt. Ltd. — Ahmedabad</p><p class=\"sb-timeline-item__desc\">Built 50+ custom themes and plugins for business-critical websites across eCommerce, LMS, and corporate platforms. Implemented custom post types, taxonomies, and user roles; integrated third-party APIs; used WP-CLI to automate DB operations and deploys; reduced page-load times through query optimisation.</p><div class=\"sb-timeline-item__tags\"><span class=\