View selected work</a></div><div class=\"sb-hero__chips\"><span class=\"sb-hero__chips-item\">WordPress VIP</span><span class=\"sb-hero__chips-item\">Gutenberg</span><span class=\"sb-hero__chips-item\">WooCommerce</span><span class=\"sb-hero__chips-item\">ACF Pro</span><span class=\"sb-hero__chips-item\">Headless WP</span><span class=\"sb-hero__chips-item\">Performance</span></div></div><div class=\"sb-hero__visual\"><div class=\"sb-image-slot\"><span class=\"sb-image-slot__label\">Image goes here</span></div></div></div><div class=\"sb-hero__metrics\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"sb-metric\" role=\"listitem\"><strong>7+</strong><span>Years of WordPress engineering</span></div><div class=\"sb-metric\" role=\"listitem\"><strong>70+</strong><span>Projects shipped end-to-end</span></div><div class=\"sb-metric\" role=\"listitem\"><strong>50+</strong><span>Custom themes &amp; plugins built</span></div><div class=\"sb-metric\" role=\"listitem\"><strong>30–50%</strong><span>Median performance gains</span></div></div></div></section>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/hero -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/about {\"className\":\"sb-section\\u002d\\u002dcream\",\"anchor\":\"about\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-about sb-section sb-about sb-reveal sb-section--cream\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"sb-container\"><div class=\"sb-about__layout\"><div class=\"sb-about__visual\"><div class=\"sb-image-slot\"><span class=\"sb-image-slot__label\">Image goes here</span></div></div><div class=\"sb-about__copy\"><span class=\"sb-eyebrow\">About</span><h2>Engineer-led WordPress, from planning to deployment.</h2><p>I\'m Sachin Suthar — based in Ahmedabad, India, with 7+ years building custom themes, plugins, and backend systems for eCommerce, LMS, and corporate platforms. I take projects from technical scoping all the way through code review and deployment: writing clean, maintainable code, fixing performance bottlenecks, and integrating third-party APIs. Familiar with WordPress VIP coding standards and best practices through certification. Currently expanding into React-based Gutenberg block development and PHPUnit testing.</p><div class=\"sb-about__highlights\"><div class=\"sb-about__highlight\"><strong>Ahmedabad, India</strong><span>Available worldwide · Remote-first</span></div><div class=\"sb-about__highlight\"><strong>7+ years experience</strong><span>Across 70+ shipped WordPress projects</span></div><div class=\"sb-about__highlight\"><strong>WP VIP standards</strong><span>Architecture, performance, and security</span></div><div class=\"sb-about__highlight\"><strong>MCA · Gujarat Tech Univ.</strong><span>CGPA 8.08 · BCA from HNGU (7.25)</span></div></div></div></div></div></section>\n<!-- /wp:smart-blocks/about -->\n\n<!-- wp:smart-blocks/services-grid {\"eyebrow\":\"01 · What I do\",\"heading\":\"Services tuned for \\u003cem\\u003eambitious\\u003c/em\\u003e WordPress products.\",\"dek\":\"Specialist services across the modern WordPress stack — from custom block development to performance engineering and CI-friendly deployments.\",\"anchor\":\"services\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-services-grid sb-section sb-services sb-reveal\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"sb-container\"><div class=\"sb-section-head\"><span class=\"sb-eyebrow\">01 · What I do</span><h2>Services tuned for <em>ambitious</em> WordPress products.</h2><p>Specialist services across the modern WordPress stack — from custom block development to performance engineering and CI-friendly deployments.</p></div><div class=\"sb-services__grid\"><!-- wp:smart-blocks/service {\"icon\":\"wp\",\"title\":\"Custom WordPress Development\",\"desc\":\"End-to-end custom themes, plugins, and admin-side tooling, built to WordPress VIP coding standards with clean architecture.\"} -->\n<article class=\"wp-block-smart-blocks-service sb-service\"><div class=\"sb-service__head\"><div class=\"sb-service__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\